1
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:09,990
When we think about healthy ageing, it
is not just a question of what we take.

2
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:11,403
We also need to ask: when?

3
00:00:11,953 --> 00:00:14,911
Imagine you start paying
more attention to nutrition.

4
00:00:14,911 --> 00:00:18,204
You choose a supplement, and
remember to take it every day.

5
00:00:18,754 --> 00:00:21,769
But when life gets busy,
mealtimes keep changing.

6
00:00:21,769 --> 00:00:23,554
Lunch gets pushed back again.

7
00:00:24,104 --> 00:00:28,008
At night, a little more time on your
phone turns into another late bedtime.
